        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): guard parseDiscordGatewayInfoBody JSON.parse against malformed API responses",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`extensions/discord/src/monitor/gateway-metadata.ts:159` calls bare `JSON.parse(body)` in `parseDiscordGatewayInfoBody()` when parsing the Discord `/gateway/bot` API response. A compromised or misconfigured Discord API endpoint returning malformed JSON would throw a raw `SyntaxError` instead of a descriptive validation error.\n\nThis follows the same pattern as merged D4 JSON.parse guard PRs: #97889 (discord api.ts), #97973 (matrix), #97999 (twilio), #98073 (signal), #98587 (slack), #98800 (gateway live-helpers).\n\n## Changes\n\n- `extensions/discord/src/monitor/gateway-metadata.ts`: wrap `JSON.parse(body)` in try/catch, throw descriptive `Error(\"Discord gateway info body is not valid JSON.\")` instead of raw SyntaxError\n- `extensions/discord/src/monitor/gateway-metadata.test.ts`: 3 new tests (malformed JSON → descriptive error, valid JSON → parsed correctly, empty body → descriptive error)\n- `test/_proof_discord_gateway_metadata_json_guard.mts`: standalone proof script that imports and calls the real `parseDiscordGatewayInfoBody()` directly\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal | AI-assisted\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Standalone proof script (L2) — calls the ACTUAL exported function\n\n```\n$ node --import tsx test/_proof_discord_gateway_metadata_json_guard.mts\n\n[1] malformed gateway info body → descriptive Error\n  PASS  throws Error (not SyntaxError)\n  PASS  message includes \"not valid JSON\"\n\n[2] valid gateway info body → returns correctly\n  PASS  no error thrown\n  PASS  returns object\n  PASS  url preserved\n  PASS  shards preserved\n\n[3] empty string → throws Error\n  PASS  throws Error for empty body\n\n[4] valid JSON but wrong schema → schema validation error\n  PASS  throws Error for schema mismatch\n  PASS  message is schema error (not JSON parse error)\n\n==================================================\n  Passed: 9  Failed: 0  Total: 9\n==================================================\n```\n\nBefore (current main): `JSON.parse(\"NOT JSON {{{\")` → raw `SyntaxError` propagates uncaught\nAfter (this PR): `parseDiscordGatewayInfoBody(\"NOT JSON {{{\")` → descriptive `Error: Discord gateway info body is not valid JSON.`\n\n### Call chain\n\n`fetchDiscordGatewayInfo()` → HTTP GET `https://discord.com/api/v10/gateway/bot` → `response.text()` → `parseDiscordGatewayInfoBody(body)` — called during gateway startup to fetch Discord gateway connection info.\n\n### Negative control (L3)\n\nStashing the try/catch and reverting to bare `JSON.parse(body)` causes the proof script to fail with raw `SyntaxError`, confirming the fix is real and the test is not a tautology.",
